VALUES ('beit-avraham', 'talmud-shabat-118b.md', 'Talmud Babli, Shabat 118b — Dijo Rabí Yojanan en nombre de Rabí Shimón bar Yojai: Si todo el pueblo de Israel guardara dos Shabatot según su ley, inmediatamente serían redimidos. El Shabat no es una carga de prohibiciones, sino una isla en el tiempo, un santuario de paz, dignidad y encuentro comunitario.', '[-0.023933,-0.007978,0.042814,-0.011435,0.010371,0.061694,-0.019678,0.03324,0,0.031379,0.04175,0.099987,0.030049,0,-0.037229,0.057174,-0.021806,0,-0.027656,-0.072863,0.002393,0.003989,-0.0359,-0.010371,0,0,0.015158,0,-0.006914,0,-0.043612,-0.011435,0.041484,0.015158,-0.035102,-0.027656,-0.00133,0.027656,-0.005318,0.024465,-0.029783,-0.032975,0,0,0.059035,0,-0.02872,0.000266,0.017817,0,0,0.004787,0.004255,0,-0.008244,-0.008244,-0.04893,0.005318,0.018083,-0.027124,0,0.099987,0.011169,0.023933,-0.029252,0.007712,0,0.032177,0.030049,-0.02872,0,-0.007978,-0.017019,0.052121,-0.021008,-0.044675,0.004521,-0.007446,0,-0.073927,-0.007712,-0.030847,0.06329,-0.031113,0.069938,0,-0.030315,0,-0.029783,-0.02154,0,-0.014094,-0.030581,-0.078713,-0.041484,0,-0.029783,-0.00851,0,-0.113018,0.029518,0.030847,0.036697,0.005053,0.015424,-0.04893,0.009307,-0.035102,-0.015424,-0.001064,-0.044675,-0.040686,0,-0.009307,0.021008,-0.041484,0,-0.04308,0.012764,0,0.03457,-0.019944,0.025529,-0.01436,0.003723,0,-0.002393,-0.017285,-0.046537,-0.015424,0.014626,0.096796,0.170191,-0.062226,-0.014626,0.049462,-0.013828,-0.021008,0.023401,0.058503,-0.05478,0.003989,-0.055046,0.026061,-0.015424,-0.026326,0,0.064885,-0.055844,0.022869,-0.027124,0.009041,-0.006382,0.039091,0.011701,0.022604,-0.073129,0.030581,-0.029783,-0.049196,0.01303,-0.020742,0.011967,-0.026592,0,-0.015424,0.006914,0.01303,-0.000798,0,0.026592,0,0.004521,0.026326,-0.034304,-0.007446,-0.040686,0.046537,0.065417,-0.008775,-0.019678,0,-0.014094,0,-0.132962,0.025529,0.067811,0,0.006382,0.012498,-0.025529,0,0.012764,-0.025795,-0.038293,-0.047334,-0.001596,-0.006116,0,0.006116,-0.027124,-0